        "title": "Craft That Speaks for Itself",
        "body": "Since 2020, Kordovan has been on a mission to bring genuine leather craftsmanship back to Pakistan. We work with the finest full-grain and veg-tan leathers, cut and stitched by hand in our Karachi workshop.\n\nEvery wallet, bag, and belt we make is meant to be used daily, carried with purpose, and passed down when the time comes. No fast fashion. No compromises.",
